#: sm-buildings.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-buildings.php
msgid ""
"Steel buildings market: new and used warehouses, agricultural and industrial"
" hangars, workshops, livestock buildings and building kits, assembled or "
"dismantled. Adds the \"buildings\" market to the SM Products listing engine:"
" dimensions and area, structural system, roof and cladding, what the price "
"includes, structural element inventory weighed by SM Weight Engine, price "
"per kg and per m², indicative drawing. Requires SM Core, SM Weight Engine "
"and SM Products 0.3.0."
msgstr ""
"Marché des bâtiments métalliques : entrepôts neufs et d’occasion, hangars "
"agricoles et industriels, ateliers, bâtiments d’élevage et kits, montés ou "
"démontés. Ajoute le marché « bâtiments » au moteur d’annonces SM Products : "
"dimensions et surface, système porteur, toiture et bardage, ce que comprend "
"le prix, inventaire des éléments pesé par SM Weight Engine, prix au kg et au"
" m², schéma indicatif. Nécessite SM Core, SM Weight Engine et SM Products "
"0.3.0."

#. Author of the plugin
#: sm-buildings.php
msgid "ReuSteel"
msgstr "ReuSteel"

